=== 3 divergence(s): ['CLOAD', 'COLOR', 'KEY'] ===
    REFS-SPLIT (5): ['KILL', 'NAME', 'FIELD', 'LSET', 'RSET'] -- the two references disagree, so
    zerobas cannot be scored on these. Most are Disk-BASIC verbs and the VG-8020
    has no disk ROM.
    🔴 ['RESUME', 'LPRINT', 'CLOAD'] produced NO reading on a side -- an absence, not agreement, and each needs a reason [[an-unnamed-outcome-reads-as-no-outcome]].
